@guestToken = Bearer replace-me
@staffToken = Bearer replace-me
@tableId = replace-me

### Join waitlist (table)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waitlist
Authorization: {{guestToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tableId": "{{tableId}}",
  "startAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00Z",
  "endAt": "2026-09-01T14:00:00Z"
}

### My waitlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waitlist/me
Authorization: {{guestToken}}

### Staff: active waitlist
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waitlist?page=0&size=20
Authorization: {{staffToken}}

### Cancel waitlist entry
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/waitlist/{{entryId}}/cancel
Authorization: {{guestToken}}
